WEBVTT

00:00.890 --> 00:02.690
In the year 845...

00:03.520 --> 00:06.770
the Colossal and Armored Titans

00:06.770 --> 00:11.150
suddenly appeared, destroying the wall,

00:11.150 --> 00:13.080
along with the life we'd known.

00:16.070 --> 00:18.490
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

00:19.280 --> 00:22.410
losing twenty percent of its population 
and a third of its territory,

00:23.040 --> 00:26.960
to retreat within Wall Rose.

00:29.880 --> 00:32.840
And in the year 850, in Trost...

00:33.970 --> 00:37.460
Once again, humanity could 
not stop a Titan invasion.

00:38.890 --> 00:42.180
Eren Jaeger had been 
devoured by a Titan,

00:43.060 --> 00:47.190
but reappeared, emerging 
from a mysterious Titan.

02:20.990 --> 02:26.000
Response 
The Battle for Trost (6)

02:26.500 --> 02:27.960
I'll ask you once more!

02:28.280 --> 02:30.250
What are you?!

02:31.250 --> 02:32.520
A human!

02:37.250 --> 02:38.510
I see...

02:39.430 --> 02:41.050
Then don't hate me for this.

02:47.270 --> 02:48.140
Marco...

02:48.140 --> 02:50.230
I can't...

02:50.520 --> 02:52.580
I can't fight the Titans anymore!

02:52.810 --> 02:53.860
What happened?

02:54.400 --> 02:56.150
My friends were eaten 
right in front of me!

02:56.400 --> 02:58.140
I saw them devoured,

02:58.140 --> 03:01.070
and I didn't even feel sad or angry...

03:01.700 --> 03:05.490
All I could think was, 
"I'm so glad that it wasn't me!"

03:06.160 --> 03:07.290
But...

03:07.290 --> 03:08.640
Next time, it'll be me...

03:09.000 --> 03:09.960
I realized something.

03:10.290 --> 03:11.710
Essentially, our job

03:11.950 --> 03:16.130
is to fight the Titans 
until they eat us, isn't it?

03:16.590 --> 03:19.470
I'd rather die right now than be eaten!

03:19.470 --> 03:20.130
Stop it...

03:20.130 --> 03:21.300
Get a hold of yourself!

03:21.600 --> 03:23.340
You aren't the only one.

03:23.340 --> 03:25.550
Everyone is struggling with that fear!

03:26.010 --> 03:27.430
Look at Sasha!

03:27.430 --> 03:30.660
Even after what happened, 
she is still a proud soldier!

03:33.770 --> 03:35.880
I have a terrible stomachache.

03:35.880 --> 03:37.870
May I go join the wounded?

03:39.860 --> 03:41.950
I can't do this anymore!

03:41.200 --> 03:41.950
Stop it!

03:42.230 --> 03:43.150
Stop!

03:44.320 --> 03:46.990
I guess that gag order 
was indeed necessary...

03:47.870 --> 03:49.870
Just look at them now.

03:50.620 --> 03:52.020
If they learn about Eren...

04:00.010 --> 04:01.090
A cannon shot?

04:01.470 --> 04:03.050
Why only one?

04:03.050 --> 04:04.640
Look! Smoke!

04:05.010 --> 04:06.180
From inside the wall!

04:07.800 --> 04:08.710
What?

04:09.890 --> 04:10.940
What's going on?

04:11.430 --> 04:13.290
Did they break through the floodgate?

04:13.560 --> 04:15.940
No way! That's the strongest part...

04:15.940 --> 04:18.300
Someone just screwed up 
and dropped a shell.

04:18.300 --> 04:21.520
But why is there so much smoke?

04:22.570 --> 04:24.700
It can't be... A Titan's steam?

04:26.620 --> 04:27.700
Wait!

04:28.780 --> 04:29.500
Hey...

04:52.430 --> 04:55.060
What is going on here?

05:16.620 --> 05:18.080
It's alive...

05:18.080 --> 05:19.460
Captain Wellman!

05:23.510 --> 05:24.840
J-Just look at it!

05:24.840 --> 05:26.630
It's too dangerous to get close!

05:26.920 --> 05:29.260
Maintain your position 
and remain on high alert!

05:29.260 --> 05:30.390
Maintain your position!

05:30.390 --> 05:33.110
Have the gunners load another round!

06:05.540 --> 06:06.880
What is this?

06:09.760 --> 06:12.350
I remember hearing the cannon fire...

06:12.850 --> 06:16.560
And then there was a horrible 
sound, a shock wave, and heat...

06:16.810 --> 06:19.600
Are we inside a huge skeleton—

06:19.600 --> 06:21.560
Eren protected us.

06:22.060 --> 06:24.270
That's all we need to know for now.

06:28.240 --> 06:30.990
Flowers survived, only inside...?

06:32.070 --> 06:32.910
Hey!

06:34.410 --> 06:35.790
Are you guys okay?!

06:36.540 --> 06:37.580
Eren!

06:37.580 --> 06:38.460
What is this?

06:38.460 --> 06:39.160
No idea...

06:39.660 --> 06:43.630
But this thing will soon dissipate 
like any other Titan corpse...

06:43.630 --> 06:44.670
Let's get away from it!

06:46.460 --> 06:49.320
Are they in shock, or just 
waiting to see what we'll do?

06:49.970 --> 06:53.150
The Garrison isn't doing 
anything right now, but...

06:54.960 --> 06:57.590
They'll attack again before long.

06:59.980 --> 07:03.500
After showing them this, I doubt we'll 
be able to talk our way out.

07:04.190 --> 07:07.170
But I do remember one thing...

07:07.570 --> 07:08.600
The basement.

07:09.030 --> 07:10.110
The basement of my house.

07:11.200 --> 07:13.850
Dad said that if I go there, 
I'll learn everything.

07:14.950 --> 07:17.450
This happened to me because of him, too.

07:18.370 --> 07:20.340
If I go to the basement,

07:21.080 --> 07:22.880
I'll probably learn what 
the Titans really are.

07:27.420 --> 07:28.170
Damn it!

07:29.310 --> 07:31.170
Then why did he hide it?

07:31.590 --> 07:32.970
Isn't that information

07:32.970 --> 07:36.720
what thousands of Survey 
Corps soldiers died for?

07:36.850 --> 07:39.240
Isn't it humanity's last hope?

07:39.980 --> 07:44.130
And he's been keeping it locked 
in the basement of our house?

07:44.850 --> 07:47.610
What the hell was he thinking?

07:50.110 --> 07:53.630
Where the hell has he been 
the past five years, anyway?

07:53.630 --> 07:54.110
Eren.

07:55.280 --> 07:57.270
Right now, we have other priorities.

07:58.790 --> 07:59.740
Yeah.

08:00.950 --> 08:02.370
The smoke's clearing.

08:02.370 --> 08:03.370
When you see them, attack.

08:03.370 --> 08:04.380
Let's end this here.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.920
Don't move yet!

08:17.220 --> 08:19.810
I'm getting out of here.

08:21.350 --> 08:23.020
Where will you go? And how?

08:23.230 --> 08:24.850
For now, I don't care where.

08:24.850 --> 08:27.310
But from there, over the walls, 
to the basement.

08:27.740 --> 08:29.480
Once I become a Titan again.

08:30.230 --> 08:32.140
Can you do that?

08:32.740 --> 08:35.280
I don't know how I do it myself.

08:35.820 --> 08:37.420
But I still think I can!

08:38.240 --> 08:42.370
It's similar to the way you can't explain 
how you move your own arm.

08:44.160 --> 08:45.260
Back there,

08:45.260 --> 08:47.970
my only thought was stopping that shell.

08:48.440 --> 08:52.380
So that body had no other function and 
rotted away after having served its purpose.

08:56.390 --> 08:58.720
This time, I'll turn 
into something stronger.

08:59.140 --> 09:03.180
A 15-meter class, like the one 
that tore apart those Titans.

09:03.180 --> 09:04.160
Eren.

09:04.890 --> 09:06.150
Your nose is bleeding.

09:08.900 --> 09:11.500
You look pale, and your 
breaths are ragged.

09:11.820 --> 09:14.440
Your body is in bad shape!

09:15.570 --> 09:17.820
How I feel doesn't matter.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.870
I've come up with two options.

09:21.460 --> 09:25.990
First, if you don't try to protect me, 
at least they won't kill you.

09:27.540 --> 09:29.540
Although I've already 
caused you trouble.

09:30.630 --> 09:33.050
I'm thinking of leaving here alone.

09:34.290 --> 09:35.380
No...

09:35.670 --> 09:36.820
I'll go, too—

09:35.940 --> 09:36.820
Eren,

09:38.260 --> 09:38.970
I'm coming with you.

09:39.180 --> 09:39.930
No!

09:40.550 --> 09:43.470
If I can't keep up, you don't 
need to worry about me.

09:43.970 --> 09:46.620
But I don't have to do what you say.

09:46.980 --> 09:48.980
I've told you to stop all that!

09:49.790 --> 09:52.580
I'm not your little brother, 
and I'm not a child!

09:52.980 --> 09:57.990
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

09:52.980 --> 09:57.990
<b>Yeast (1) 
A special yeast made only within Wall Sina keeps 
fodder, wheat, beans, and other items from spoiling 
for a long time when placed in storerooms or tents.</b>

09:57.990 --> 10:02.990
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

09:57.990 --> 10:02.990
<b>Yeast (2) 
By seeding storage caches with 
this yeast along supply lanes, 
humanity prepares to retake Wall Maria.</b>

10:05.180 --> 10:09.040
Captain, the next round 
will be loaded soon.

10:09.310 --> 10:11.670
Should we attack again?

10:13.310 --> 10:15.360
Wait for my signal!

10:16.290 --> 10:17.340
Yes, sir.

10:18.250 --> 10:23.010
The Garrison's giving no indication of 
moving to attack with their blades.

10:23.500 --> 10:28.390
Mikasa's more sensitive than 
a stray cat to those things.

10:28.910 --> 10:31.590
Loading the next round will probably take

10:32.150 --> 10:34.230
a minimum of another twenty seconds.

10:34.740 --> 10:38.400
Before then, Eren will have 
made his move and left...

10:43.090 --> 10:46.760
Why would I remember these 
things at a time like this?

10:48.060 --> 10:52.080
Is it because this is it for us?

10:53.380 --> 10:55.380
And at the end, I was

10:56.570 --> 11:00.240
nothing more than a coward, after all...

11:02.600 --> 11:05.060
They saved me over and over,

11:05.790 --> 11:10.350
but I was never able to save them.

11:14.150 --> 11:18.530
As a friend, how can I stand 
on equal ground with them?

11:18.960 --> 11:22.860
How could I say I'd go with them?

11:23.490 --> 11:25.850
When even I'm not sure I can?

11:36.450 --> 11:38.630
Now, the three of us

11:41.720 --> 11:45.650
will probably never 
be together again...

11:47.180 --> 11:48.240
Eren, I...

11:48.240 --> 11:49.560
Wait, Mikasa.

11:50.020 --> 11:52.300
I said I've come up with two options.

11:53.540 --> 11:54.760
Armin,

11:54.760 --> 11:56.650
I'll let you decide.

11:58.430 --> 11:59.390
Huh?

11:59.390 --> 12:03.830
I know what I've just 
said isn't that realistic.

12:04.230 --> 12:05.450
The smartest thing to do

12:05.960 --> 12:10.050
would be to stay with the troops 
and use this ability strategically.

12:12.220 --> 12:13.420
I know it's crazy...

12:14.500 --> 12:20.370
But if you think you can convince 
the Garrison I'm not a threat right now,

12:21.540 --> 12:24.030
I will trust your judgment and follow your lead.

12:24.700 --> 12:26.430
That's my second option.

12:27.590 --> 12:31.810
If you say you can't, I'll do 
what I described before.

12:33.740 --> 12:35.520
You have fifteen seconds to decide.

12:36.430 --> 12:37.970
Whether or not you can,

12:38.500 --> 12:41.330
I'll respect your decision.

12:46.170 --> 12:47.410
Eren...

12:48.000 --> 12:51.070
Why would you entrust 
me with this choice?

12:51.810 --> 12:54.020
Whenever things get really bad,

12:54.020 --> 12:57.010
you always know the right thing to do.

12:57.580 --> 12:59.960
And I want to rely on you.

13:00.780 --> 13:02.460
When have I...

13:02.760 --> 13:04.580
There have been plenty of times.

13:04.580 --> 13:09.000
Five years ago, if you 
hadn't called Hannes,

13:09.530 --> 13:12.430
Titans would have eaten Mikasa and me.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.740
Was it all...

13:23.400 --> 13:25.130
just in my head?

13:27.230 --> 13:31.680
Only I thought that I was useless? 
That I was just slowing them down?

13:35.270 --> 13:38.760
These two never thought 
that for a second!

13:39.040 --> 13:41.200
Armin, we're out of time!

13:44.140 --> 13:45.760
Looks like the next round is loaded.

13:46.310 --> 13:47.510
We can fire any time.

13:48.350 --> 13:51.190
These two are putting 
their lives in my hands.

13:52.020 --> 13:56.130
The two people I trust 
most in the world...

13:57.470 --> 14:01.290
What could be more convincing than that?

14:05.140 --> 14:06.970
I will persuade them.

14:07.590 --> 14:10.980
The two of you, avoid doing anything 
that'd make them think you're a threat.

14:17.970 --> 14:20.890
Ever since Eren became 
a Titan and fought for us,

14:20.890 --> 14:22.650
something has been bothering me.

14:23.050 --> 14:25.970
I don't have it all clear in 
my head, but I'll do this!

14:25.970 --> 14:28.220
I'll figure it out while I speak!

14:32.920 --> 14:33.850
Stop!

14:39.140 --> 14:41.960
You've finally shown 
your true self, monster!

14:41.960 --> 14:42.820
I'll do it!

14:42.820 --> 14:44.980
I'll give the signal!

14:45.200 --> 14:47.710
He is not an enemy of humanity!

14:47.710 --> 14:52.200
We are prepared to share 
all the information we have!

14:52.200 --> 14:54.530
I'm not interested in hearing 
you plead for your lives!

14:54.530 --> 14:58.210
How can I believe you, when he's 
shown us all what he really is?

14:58.380 --> 15:01.390
If you say he's not an 
enemy, then prove it!

15:01.390 --> 15:04.460
If you can't, I'll be forced 
to eliminate the threat!

15:04.870 --> 15:06.790
There is no need for proof!

15:07.150 --> 15:09.600
That's right... We don't.

15:10.160 --> 15:14.630
The question isn't what we think of him!

15:14.630 --> 15:15.470
What did you say?

15:15.880 --> 15:18.480
I'm told that many of you saw him!

15:18.740 --> 15:22.040
Then you saw him fighting the Titans!

15:22.040 --> 15:25.520
And you saw the Titans swarm him!

15:26.940 --> 15:32.700
That means the Titans considered him 
food, the same way they think of us!

15:33.070 --> 15:37.700
<i>That</i> is the truth, no matter 
what we may think or believe!

15:41.980 --> 15:43.330
He's right...

15:43.690 --> 15:44.950
A Titan as an ally?

15:44.950 --> 15:46.340
That's impossible.

15:46.490 --> 15:49.340
But if we could control a Titan...

15:55.720 --> 15:57.220
Prepare to attack!

15:57.540 --> 16:00.460
Don't be fooled by their clever lies!

16:02.460 --> 16:05.810
The Titans' actions have always 
been beyond our understanding!

16:05.810 --> 16:09.030
It's possible they could 
pretend to be human,

16:09.030 --> 16:12.530
speak human languages, 
and try to deceive us!

16:12.740 --> 16:15.370
We can't let them get 
away with anything else!

16:20.430 --> 16:21.520
No...

16:21.990 --> 16:24.120
He isn't even trying to think!

16:24.900 --> 16:27.100
He's scared of thinking!

16:28.880 --> 16:30.290
Eren... Mikasa!

16:40.720 --> 16:42.390
I am a soldier!

16:42.390 --> 16:46.310
I swore long ago to dedicate 
my life to the revival of humanity!

16:46.640 --> 16:50.780
If that pursuit were to cost 
me my life, I would be glad!

16:51.210 --> 16:55.740
If we use his Titan powers and 
the forces we still have,

16:55.740 --> 16:58.900
we could take back this town!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.160
With my final breath before my death,

17:01.530 --> 17:03.960
I shall wish for humanity's glory,

17:04.450 --> 17:07.130
and try to persuade you 
of his strategic value!

17:11.800 --> 17:15.050
Captain Wellman, I believe 
we should consider—

17:15.050 --> 17:16.420
Shut up!

17:18.430 --> 17:20.160
Their pleas are irrelevant.

17:20.160 --> 17:22.030
They are traitors.

17:22.030 --> 17:24.020
Anyone who violates the 
rules must be eliminated.

17:24.380 --> 17:26.940
That is my duty as a soldier!

17:31.490 --> 17:32.650
Enough.

17:34.230 --> 17:38.660
As big as you are, you've always been 
as delicate as a newborn fawn.

17:40.540 --> 17:42.190
Commander Pixis!

17:44.230 --> 17:47.370
Do you not see his splendid salute?

17:50.450 --> 17:54.270
I've just arrived, but messengers have 
kept me abreast of the situation.

17:55.090 --> 17:57.000
You go command the reinforcements.

17:57.600 --> 18:02.260
I think we should listen to them...

18:09.180 --> 18:12.000
Reports by the Survey Corps had said

18:12.000 --> 18:14.770
the Titans would come from the south.

18:15.590 --> 18:19.430
In fact, it was Zhiganshina District,

18:19.430 --> 18:22.390
south of Wall Maria, that was attacked.

18:23.070 --> 18:28.540
Thus, it was widely believed that 
the district south of Wall Rose,

18:28.540 --> 18:32.450
Trost, had the highest likelihood 
of being the next target.

18:34.430 --> 18:37.390
Trost District, Inner Gate

18:37.760 --> 18:39.280
Dot Pixis...

18:39.920 --> 18:41.930
He is the High Commander

18:41.930 --> 18:45.140
of the entire southern region, including Trost.

18:45.700 --> 18:47.370
The man with absolute authority over

18:47.370 --> 18:50.190
the defense of humanity's most important region.

18:52.690 --> 18:54.980
No luck, huh?

18:55.370 --> 18:59.800
I wouldn't mind being eaten by a 
really beautiful Titan woman.

19:00.450 --> 19:04.200
And he is known to be a total eccentric.

19:05.310 --> 19:07.830
What is the Commander thinking?

19:07.830 --> 19:09.460
Allowing them up there unguarded,

19:09.460 --> 19:11.710
when we don't know what they are...

19:11.900 --> 19:13.130
I don't know.

19:13.130 --> 19:17.430
The Commander's ideas are always 
beyond normal people's comprehension.

19:17.430 --> 19:18.590
Captain...

19:19.650 --> 19:21.450
The squads are in formation.

19:21.770 --> 19:23.720
Oh, excellent.

19:29.460 --> 19:30.820
I see.

19:30.820 --> 19:33.520
And if we reach this basement, 
we'll understand everything?

19:33.520 --> 19:35.770
Yes... Will you believe me?

19:36.690 --> 19:39.320
As long as you, yourself, 
lack absolute conviction,

19:39.320 --> 19:43.390
I can't promise more than 
that I'll keep it in mind.

19:43.820 --> 19:48.700
But I do take pride in being able to 
recognize the truth of what I see.

19:49.340 --> 19:52.500
I'll guarantee your safety.

19:55.010 --> 19:57.730
Trainee Arlert, was it?

19:57.960 --> 19:58.770
Yes, sir!

19:59.180 --> 20:02.760
Back there, you said we could use

20:02.760 --> 20:05.880
the Titan's power to reclaim this city.

20:06.290 --> 20:08.140
Did you really think so?

20:08.440 --> 20:11.270
Or was it just a plea to save your life?

20:12.450 --> 20:13.670
Well...

20:14.710 --> 20:15.810
Both.

20:17.160 --> 20:19.350
What I meant was to have

20:19.930 --> 20:22.990
Eren become a Titan, 
then move that boulder

20:23.260 --> 20:25.930
to seal the destroyed gate.

20:27.120 --> 20:29.500
But it was just an idea...

20:30.870 --> 20:33.400
I thought I could get them to at least

20:33.400 --> 20:36.760
at least consider using Eren's power 
to find a way out of our predicament.

20:40.530 --> 20:43.520
Of course, I wanted to survive!

20:45.250 --> 20:47.300
You wanted to survive.

20:47.720 --> 20:50.050
I can trust those words 
more than any others.

20:59.220 --> 21:01.610
Well, Trainee Jaeger?

21:02.530 --> 21:03.200
Yes?

21:04.040 --> 21:06.870
Can you seal that hole?

21:08.560 --> 21:11.100
Well... Well...

21:12.150 --> 21:13.230
I don't know.

21:13.720 --> 21:18.520
I don't know much more than 
everyone else here does.

21:19.300 --> 21:23.500
So... whether I can do it or not,

21:23.910 --> 21:25.730
I can't answer you for 
sure when I don't know.

21:25.730 --> 21:27.170
That's true.

21:27.170 --> 21:28.500
I'm sorry.

21:28.500 --> 21:30.910
I asked the wrong question.

21:32.760 --> 21:35.850
Will you do it? Or won't you?

22:05.550 --> 22:06.660
I'll do it.

22:08.540 --> 22:09.550
I'll do it!

22:10.020 --> 22:12.510
I don't know whether 
I can seal the hole...

22:12.830 --> 22:15.320
But I'll do it!

23:54.230 --> 23:56.740
Although they had fled out of fear,

23:56.740 --> 24:00.770
soldiers choose to stand 
once more on the battlefield.

24:01.290 --> 24:05.600
Eren decides to become everyone's hope.

24:05.170 --> 24:08.300
Icon
The Battle for Trost (7)
